    "description": {
      "content": "The Old Dominion Freight Line Document API retrieves PDF documents associated with shipments, including bills of lading and delivery receipts, by PRO number. The service is used to programmatically pull shipment documentation from ODFL into shipper or partner systems.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: ODFL API Support\n Email: api@odfl.com",
